    <string name="battery_help_profiles">What it does: a profile groups triggers and app rules. Several profiles can be active at the same time: the ones you start by hand and those whose enabled trigger is met. Every trigger is off until you turn it on.\n\nWhen active profiles give one app different actions, the most restrictive wins (Osserva, then Limita in background, then Arresta quando esco). Protected apps are always excluded.\n\nIn this version profiles do not change any app yet.\n\nUndo: stop the profile or switch it off.</string>
    <string name="battery_help_most_restrictive">Each row shows the action that would apply to the app and the profile that sets it. When several active profiles disagree, the most restrictive action wins. Protected apps never appear here.\n\nIn this version nothing is applied: this is a preview.</string>

    <!-- Profile levels (BAT-003); same terms as Apps -->
