    <string name="battery_help_triggers_editor">What it does: the profile is active while any trigger that is on is met, and it ends when none is. New triggers start off; nothing activates until you turn it on.\n\nRisk: in this version no app is changed. Later, a profile will run only the actions you reviewed; freezing or disabling apps is never automatic.\n\nUndo: turn the trigger off or remove it.</string>
    <string name="battery_help_trigger_battery">What it does: starts when the battery drops below the start level and ends only above the end level, so the profile does not flip on and off. With “Only while unplugged”, charging ends it immediately.\n\nUndo: turn the trigger off.</string>
    <string name="battery_help_trigger_schedule">What it does: active every chosen day between the start and end time. A window that crosses midnight belongs to the day it starts (Monday 22:00–06:00 includes early Tuesday).\n\nUndo: turn the trigger off.</string>
    <string name="battery_help_trigger_screen_off">What it does: starts after the screen stays off for the chosen time and ends when the screen turns on. Able can measure this only while the live monitor runs.\n\nUndo: turn the trigger off.</string>
    <string name="battery_help_trigger_charging">What it does: active while the phone is plugged in; it ends when you unplug it.\n\nUndo: turn the trigger off.</string>
