    <string name="battery_editor_offer_saver">Suggest Android Battery Saver</string>
    <string name="battery_editor_offer_saver_body">While active, Able suggests Android\'s saver. Able never turns it on.</string>
    <string name="battery_help_offer_saver">What it does: while this profile is active, the Status tab suggests opening Android Battery Saver. Android manages the saver; Able does not switch it on or off.\n\nUndo: turn the switch off.</string>
    <string name="battery_editor_apps">App rules</string>
    <string name="battery_help_app_levels">Osserva only shows information. Limita in background applies a supported Android restriction while the profile is active. Arresta quando esco force-stops the app after you leave it.\n\nRisk: notifications, sync and alarms can be delayed or missed.\n\nWhen several active profiles disagree, the most restrictive level wins. Protected apps are always excluded.\n\nUndo: set the rule back to Osserva.</string>
